** Advancing a weak jump overcall when they bid on (batch 7)

A weak jump overcall shows a six-card suit. When they bid on at the two or
three level, advancer raises to the three level with three-card support (the
law of total tricks: a nine-card fit competes to the three level), bids game in
a major with 13+ and support (in a minor, four of it), and otherwise passes. `#ANYORDER`: their new suit
may lie above or below their opening suit.

